UID:S2FjWLwIEm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 200 mins (3h20m)\n\n7:30pm | SIFF Cinema Uptown  Yo
 ur favorite secret movie purveyors are back\, and this time it’s twice t
 he fun! A spoopy movie to start and a spooky movie to finish! Come for one
  or the other but you’d be wise to stay for both - if you dare!\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/classified-cinema-secret-movie-double-f
 eature\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
