BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Skweezy Jibbs
DTSTART:20251105T033000Z
DTEND:20251105T051000Z
DTSTAMP:20251105T033000Z
UID:CfvLsUXkOK
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nOddball internet legend Skweezy J
 ibbs is making the movie of his dreams. Unfortunately for him\, he's got n
 o money\, no experience\, no skill\, and no filmmaking talent. Be among th
 e first people to see the movie\, and stay for an exclusive Q&A with Skwee
 zy himself. One night only!\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/skw
 eezy-jibbs-makes-a-movie\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Ascent (1977)
DTSTART:20251106T020000Z
DTEND:20251106T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20251106T020000Z
UID:nZf50CJ5pm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Shepitko’s emo
 tionally overwhelming final film won the Golden Bear at the 1977 Berlin Fi
 lm Festival and has been hailed around the world as the finest Soviet film
  of its decade. Set during World War II's darkest days\, The Ascent follow
 s the path of two peasant soldiers\, cut off from their troop\, who trudge
  through the snowy backwoods of Belarus seeking refuge among villagers. Th
 eir harrowing trek leads them on a journey of betrayal\, heroism\, and ult
 imate transcendence.  Introduced by SIFF Cinema Staff Member Adam Plesser
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/the-ascent\n
 \nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Quiz Show (1994)
DTSTART:20251111T020000Z
DTEND:20251111T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20251111T020000Z
UID:HtvILnqUt6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 133 mins (2h13m)\n\nTalking Pictures Join SIFF for T
 alking Pictures\, a new series of film experiences where local luminaries 
 host a screening of a film of their choice at SIFF Cinemas and share with 
 audiences how it has impacted them. On November 10\, “Jeopardy!” Host 
 and Seattle native Ken Jennings will present Quiz Show (1994) at SIFF Cine
 ma Uptown.  The Talking Pictures series raises funds to support SIFF and 
 a portion of the ticket price includes a donation. TICKETS:Member Pre-Sale
  - Monday\, September 29\, 10:00am PTOn sale to general public - Wednesday
 \, October 1\, 10:00am PT $35 General | $30 Members\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/programs-and-events/talking-pictures/ken-jennings-quiz-show\n\nEstimated
  start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
